q049-2,q049,ABSK131 in vivo single-agent monotherapy tumour growth inhibition TGI tumour regression or shrinkage in MTAP-Deleted KRAS G12D-Mutated Pancreatic Ductal Adenocarcinoma animal models,ABSK131 PDAC xenograft monotherapy tumour regression,4,IDE397 / Ideaya Biosci - LARVOL DELTA,https://delta.larvol.com/Products/?ProductId=4f847675-044d-4618-bfbc-99f5a8416591,delta.larvol.com,,"## Synergistic antitumor activity of the MTA-cooperative PRMT5 inhibitor ABSK131 in combination with multiple therapeutic agents in diverse cancer models (AACR 2026) - ""In KRAS-mutant and MTAP-deleted models, ABSK131 led to robust tumor growth inhibition when combined with KRAS G12C inhibitor AMG510",,,
